
Ek gaon mein ek pyari si Daadi rehti thi. Roz subah wo talab ke paas jaakar machhliyon se baat karti thi.
Ek din ek fish ne pani se jhaank kar kaha,
“Daadi, aaj mujhe bhookh lag rahi hai!”
Daadi hans kar boli,
“Beta, bhookh sirf tumhe hi nahi lagti, mujhe bhi lagti hai.”
Daadi ne fish ko thoda sa dana diya aur pyaar se kaha,
“Jitna chahiye utna lo, lalach mat karo.”
Fish muskurayi aur boli,
“Daadi, aaj se main bhi sabke saath share karungi.”

